  "solution": {
    "text": "As the concentration of reactant decreases from 0.8 to 0.4 in 15 minutes, hence the $t_{1 / 2}$ is 15 minutes. To fall the concentration from 0.1 to 0.025 , we need two half lives, i.e., 30 minutes.",
